/*
  SignalConfigModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0016 · SignalConfigModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `SignalConfigModal`
  resolves (table "SignalConfigModal") lives here with its English value. The web source
  (components/ui/SignalConfigModal.tsx) hardcodes its copy; the native surface routes every string
  through a key so no English literal lives in Swift. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so
  each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Groups: dialog chrome + states; the footer / summary; the master controls; the category / row
  chrome + accessibility; the 8 preset names + descriptions (web `PRESETS`); and the 10 interval
  descriptors (web `INTERVAL_OPTIONS[i].desc`).
*/

